          "$deleted": true,
          "details": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/02_WAR/inner_release.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.UqXGUQM31kWc7BTc]{Unleash}</strong></p>\n<p>Becomes resistance to all damage type until the end of scene.</p>",
