        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When other creature is targeted by a melee attack,&nbsp;<strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> may take their place. <strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> takes half damage from this attack. Once used, this skill cannot be used again until next round.</p>",
