      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When a melee attack targeted at&nbsp;<strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> misses,&nbsp;<strong>Yudo Bandit&nbsp;</strong>may perform ⚔️<strong>Blunt of the Spear </strong>against the attacker.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Block and Blow"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": true,
          "details": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/02_WAR/inner_release.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.UqXGUQM31kWc7BTc]{Unleash}</strong></p>\n<p>Perform <strong>Guarding Formation</strong> at the start of conflict</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Battle Ready"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>If&nbsp;<strong>Yudo Bandit&nbsp;</strong>becomes the last creature on its side during conflict, it becomes <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/02_WAR/infuriate.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.aPF9gzkqnUkcQmIC]{Berserk},&nbsp;</strong>and may perform <strong>⚔️Blunt of the Spear&nbsp;</strong>and <strong>⚔️Tip of the Spear.&nbsp;</strong>Each successful hit will take 100 Zenit from the attacked creature.</p>\n<p><strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> then attempt to leave the scene. Perform an Opposed <strong>【DEX+ INS】</strong>Check against the opposing party. On success,&nbsp;<strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> successfully flee the scene.&nbsp;<strong>Yudo Bandit&nbsp;</strong>has 3 bonus to this Check.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Failed Protector, Success Bandit"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>On defeat, <strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> drops <strong>all stolen Zenit</strong> + 1000.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Failed Bandit, Failed Father"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p><strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> flee the scene while the opposing party retrieve the dropped Zenits. 900 of those Zenit is fake.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Successful Actor"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Yudo Bandit challenges the opposing party to the duel.</p>\n<p>When agreed,&nbsp;<strong>Yudo Bandit&nbsp;</strong>attacks will <strong>NOT</strong> steal target's Zenit. Once the battle is done:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>If the <strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> won the battle, player <strong>lost all</strong> <strong>Zenit.</strong></li>\n<li>If the Player won the battle, player <strong>receives 1000 Zenit.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Either way, <strong>Yudo Bandit</strong> will not show up against the players again.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Duel of Past Warrior"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When Yudo Bandit spend Ultima Point, he may do so without spending Action.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Formidable Spirit"
        }
      },
